  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet finaniserar uppbyggnaden av lager av f&#xf6;rn&#xf6;denheter hos UNICEF i La Paz f&#xf6;r att snabbt kunna reagera vid naturkatastrofer. Detta &#xe4;r fr&#xe4;mst t&#xe4;nkt att anv&#xe4;ndas vid de &#xf6;versv&#xe4;mningar som regelbundet drabbat Bolivia under senare &#xe5;r.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project finances the stockpiling of supplies with UNICEF in La Paz, which should permit a rapid response in the case of natural disasters. These stockpiles are primarily intended for use during the inundations which have regularly affected Bolivia during recent years.</narrative>
  </description>
